{"id":"bd061ce9e9cfed57082e62b1fd20410d00a31984","axis":"silent","repo":"hibernate/hibernate-orm","sha":"bd061ce9e9cfed57082e62b1fd20410d00a31984","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"documentation/src/main/asciidoc/userguide/chapters/domain/collections.adoc","lines":["@@ -80,21 +80,50 @@ include::{example-dir-collection}/classification/list/EntityWithList.java[tags=c"," ----"," ===="," ","-Contrary to natural expectations, the ordering of a list is by default not maintained.","-To maintain the order, it is necessary to explicitly use the `jakarta.persistence.OrderColumn` annotation.","+By default, the ordering of a list is not maintained.","+Use `@OrderColumn` to explicitly persist element positions, or declare `@DefaultListSemantics(LIST)`","+on a package or module to use an implicit order column for eligible list attributes."," ","-[[NOTE]]","+[source,java]","+----","+@DefaultListSemantics(LIST)","+package org.example.domain;","+","+import org.hibernate.annotations.DefaultListSemantics;","+import static org.hibernate.annotations.DefaultListSemantics.Classification.LIST;","+----","+","+For ordinary `List` mappings, Hibernate determines the classification in this order:","+","+. `@Bag` means `BAG`.","+. Collection-identifier metadata such as `@CollectionId` means `ID_BAG`.","+. Explicit list-index metadata such as `@OrderColumn` or `@ListIndexBase` means `LIST`.","+. `@OrderBy` or `@SQLOrder` means `BAG`.","+. Unowned to-many associations without explicit list-index metadata mean `BAG`.","+. Otherwise, consult `@DefaultListSemantics`, falling back to the existing configured default, or `BAG`.","+","+Existing validation of incompatible annotations still applies. For example, `@Bag` cannot be combined","+with `@OrderColumn` or `@ListIndexBase`. Custom collection types retain their own classification.","+","+The package annotation takes precedence over the module annotation, and both override the configured default.","+A package annotation applies only to that exact package, not to subpackages.","+Inherited attributes use their declaring type's package and module; attributes of embeddables use the","+embeddable's package and module, even when embedded in an entity in another package.","+Use `@DefaultListSemantics(BAG)` to select bag semantics in a scope whose surrounding default is `LIST`.","+","+The `hibernate.mapping.default_list_semantics` setting is deprecated in favor of this annotation and is","+scheduled for removal in ORM 9.0. Explicit use of the setting logs a deprecation warning, even when an","+annotation overrides it. Until removal, the setting remains a fallback for scopes without the annotation.","+The programmatic `MetadataBuilder.applyImplicitListSemantics()` default also remains supported.","+","+[NOTE]"," ====","-Starting in 6.0, Hibernate allows to configure the default semantics of `List` without `@OrderColumn`","-via the `hibernate.mapping.default_list_semantics` setting.","-To switch to the more natural LIST semantics with an implicit order-column, set the setting to `LIST`.","-Beware that default LIST semantics only affects owned collection mappings.","+Default `LIST` semantics only affect owned collection mappings."," Unowned mappings like `@ManyToMany(mappedBy = \"...\")` and `@OneToMany(mappedBy = \"...\")` do not retain the element"," order by default, and explicitly annotating `@OrderColumn` for `@ManyToMany(mappedBy = \"...\")` mappings is illegal."," "," To retain the order of elements of a `@OneToMany(mappedBy = \"...\")` the `@OrderColumn` annotation must be applied","-explicitly. In addition to that, it is important that both sides of the relationship, the `@OneToMany(mappedBy = \"...\")`","-and the `@ManyToOne`, must be kept in sync. Otherwise, the element position will not be updated accordingly.","+explicitly. Both sides of the relationship must be kept in sync for element positions to be updated correctly."," "," The default column name that stores the index is derived from the attribute name, by suffixing `_ORDER`."," ====","@@ -278,8 +307,8 @@ include::{example-dir-collection}/classification/bag/EntityWithBagAsList.java[ta"," Specifically, the usage of `@Bag` forces the classification as BAG.  Even though the `names` attribute is defined"," as `List`, Hibernate will treat it using the BAG semantics."," ","-Additionally, as discussed in <<collection-list>>, the `hibernate.mapping.default_list_semantics` setting","-is available to have Hibernate interpret a `List` with no `@OrderColumn` and no `@ListIndexBase` as a BAG.","+As discussed in <<collection-list>>, `@DefaultListSemantics(BAG)` on a package or module selects","+bag semantics for eligible lists. An attribute-level `@Bag` overrides a scoped `LIST` default."," "," "," An ID_BAG is similar to a BAG, except that it maps a generated, per-row identifier into the collection","@@ -616,10 +645,15 @@ When rerunning the previous example, the child will get removed because the pare"," ==== Ordered Lists"," "," Although they use the `List` interface on the Java side, bags don't retain element order.","-To preserve the collection element order, there are two possibilities:","+Ordering may be defined in the following ways:","+","+`@OrderBy`:: the collection is ordered upon retrieval using element state","+`@SQLOrder`:: the collection is ordered upon retrieval using a SQL expression","+`@OrderColumn`:: the collection uses a dedicated column to persist element positions"," ","-`@OrderBy`:: the collection is ordered upon retrieval using a child entity property","-`@OrderColumn`:: the collection uses a dedicated order column in the collection link table","+Without explicit list-index metadata, `@OrderBy` and `@SQLOrder` retain bag classification","+and do not consult `@DefaultListSemantics`.","+For eligible lists without explicit ordering metadata, `@DefaultListSemantics(LIST)` supplies an implicit order column."," "," [[collections-unidirectional-ordered-list]]"," ===== Unidirectional ordered lists"],"additions":48,"deletions":14,"truncated":false},{"path":"hibernate-core/src/main/java/org/hibernate/annotations/Bag.java","lines":["@@ -16,9 +16,9 @@"," /// [bag][org.hibernate.metamodel.CollectionClassification#BAG] - that the order of"," /// the list elements is not significant, and should not be persistent."," ///","-/// This annotation is not necessary, and has no effect, unless the configuration","-/// property {@value org.hibernate.cfg.AvailableSettings#DEFAULT_LIST_SEMANTICS}","-/// is set to {@link org.hibernate.metamodel.CollectionClassification#LIST}.","+/// This annotation is not necessary unless the default list semantics are","+/// [LIST][DefaultListSemantics.Classification#LIST], for example via","+/// [DefaultListSemantics] on the declaring package or module."," /// However, its use is still encouraged, since the explicit annotation serves"," /// as useful documentation."," ///"],"additions":3,"deletions":3,"truncated":false},{"path":"hibernate-core/src/main/java/org/hibernate/annotations/DefaultListSemantics.java","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,50 @@","+/*","+ * SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0","+ * Copyright Red Hat Inc. and Hibernate Authors","+ */","+package org.hibernate.annotations;","+","+import java.lang.annotation.Retention;","+import java.lang.annotation.Target;","+","+import jakarta.persistence.spi.Discoverable;","+import org.hibernate.Incubating;","+","+import static java.lang.annotation.ElementType.MODULE;","+import static java.lang.annotation.ElementType.PACKAGE;","+import static java.lang.annotation.RetentionPolicy.RUNTIME;","+","+/// Specifies the default semantics of persistent [java.util.List] attributes","+/// without explicit collection classification or ordering metadata.","+///","+/// The annotation on the package declaring an attribute takes precedence over","+/// the annotation on its module. Package defaults do not apply to subpackages.","+/// Inherited attributes and attributes of embeddables use their declaring","+/// type's package and module, not those of the containing entity.","+///","+/// Explicit mapping metadata takes precedence over this default. In particular,","+/// in the absence of explicit list-index metadata, lists with","+/// [jakarta.persistence.OrderBy] or [SQLOrder], and unowned to-many associations,","+/// retain bag semantics.","+///","+/// In the absence of this annotation, the configured implicit list semantics","+/// apply, defaulting to [Classification#BAG].","+///","+/// @since 8.0","+/// @author Steve Ebersole","+@Target({PACKAGE, MODULE})","+@Retention(RUNTIME)","+@Discoverable","+@Incubating(since = \"8.0\")","+public @interface DefaultListSemantics {","+\t/// The semantics to use for eligible list attributes.","+\tClassification value();","+","+\t/// The supported defaults for list attributes.","+\tenum Classification {","+\t\t/// Element positions are not persistent.","+\t\tBAG,","+\t\t/// Element positions are persistent, using an implicit order column.","+\t\tLIST","+\t}","+}"],"additions":50,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"hibernate-core/src/main/java/org/hibernate/boot/MetadataBuilder.java","lines":["@@ -185,6 +185,16 @@ public interface MetadataBuilder {"," \t */"," \tMetadataBuilder applyArchiveDescriptorFactory(ArchiveDescriptorFactory factory);"," ","+\t/**","+\t * Specify the default classification for eligible list attributes.","+\t *","+\t * @param classification The implicit list classification","+\t * @return {@code this}, for method chaining","+\t *","+\t * @deprecated Use {@link org.hibernate.annotations.DefaultListSemantics} on a package or module.","+\t * Scheduled for removal in 9.0.","+\t */","+\t@Deprecated(since = \"8.0\", forRemoval = true)"," \tMetadataBuilder applyImplicitListSemantics(CollectionClassification classification);"," "," \t/**"],"additions":10,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"hibernate-core/src/main/java/org/hibernate/boot/internal/MetadataBuilderImpl.java","lines":["@@ -233,6 +233,7 @@ public MetadataBuilder applyArchiveDescriptorFactory(ArchiveDescriptorFactory fa"," \t}"," "," \t@Override","+\t@Deprecated(since = \"8.0\", forRemoval = true)"," \tpublic MetadataBuilder applyImplicitListSemantics(CollectionClassification classification) {"," \t\tif ( classification != null ) {"," \t\t\toptions.mappingDefaults.implicitListClassification = classification;","@@ -526,6 +527,7 @@ public MappingDefaultsImpl(StandardServiceRegistry serviceRegistry) {"," \t\t\timplicitListClassification = configService.getSetting("," \t\t\t\t\tDEFAULT_LIST_SEMANTICS,"," \t\t\t\t\tvalue -> {","+\t\t\t\t\t\tDEPRECATION_LOGGER.deprecatedSetting( DEFAULT_LIST_SEMANTICS, \"@DefaultListSemantics\" );"," \t\t\t\t\t\tfinal var classification = CollectionClassification.interpretSetting( value );"," \t\t\t\t\t\tif ( classification != CollectionClassification.LIST"," \t\t\t\t\t\t\t&& classification != CollectionClassification.BAG ) {","@@ -613,6 +615,7 @@ public AccessType getImplicitCacheAccessType() {"," \t\t}"," "," \t\t@Override","+\t\t@Deprecated(since = \"8.0\", forRemoval = true)"," \t\tpublic CollectionClassification getImplicitListClassification() {"," \t\t\treturn implicitListClassification;"," \t\t}"],"additions":3,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"hibernate-core/src/main/java/org/hibernate/boot/model/internal/CollectionBinder.java","lines":["@@ -42,6 +42,7 @@"," import org.hibernate.annotations.CollectionIdJdbcTypeCode;"," import org.hibernate.annotations.CollectionType;"," import org.hibernate.annotations.CompositeType;","+import org.hibernate.annotations.DefaultListSemantics;"," import org.hibernate.annotations.EmbeddedTable;"," import org.hibernate.annotations.Fetch;"," import org.hibernate.annotations.FetchProfileOverride;","@@ -1004,7 +1005,7 @@ private static CollectionClassification determineCollectionClassification("," \t\t\t}"," "," \t\t\t// otherwise, return the implicit classification for List attributes","-\t\t\treturn buildingContext.getBuildingOptions().getMappingDefaults().getImplicitListClassification();","+\t\t\treturn determineDefaultListSemantics( property, buildingContext );"," \t\t}"," "," \t\tif ( java.util.SortedSet.class.isAssignableFrom( semanticJavaType ) ) {","@@ -1032,6 +1033,33 @@ private static CollectionClassification determineCollectionClassification("," \t\treturn null;"," \t}"," ","+\tprivate static CollectionClassification determineDefaultListSemantics(","+\t\t\tMemberDetails property,","+\t\t\tMetadataBuildingContext buildingContext) {","+\t\tfinal var declaringType = property.getDeclaringType();","+\t\tif ( !declaringType.isRealClass() ) {","+\t\t\treturn buildingContext.getBuildingOptions().getMappingDefaults().getImplicitListClassification();","+\t\t}","+\t\tfinal var modelsContext = buildingContext.getBootstrapContext().getModelsContext();","+\t\tfinal var packageInfo = GeneratorAnnotationHelper.locatePackageInfoDetails( declaringType, modelsContext );","+\t\tif ( packageInfo != null ) {","+\t\t\tfinal var annotation = packageInfo.getDirectAnnotationUsage( DefaultListSemantics.class );","+\t\t\tif ( annotation != null ) {","+\t\t\t\treturn CollectionClassification.valueOf( annotation.value().name() );","+\t\t\t}","+\t\t}","+","+\t\tfinal var module = declaringType.toJavaClass().getModule();","+\t\tif ( module.isNamed() ) {","+\t\t\tfinal var moduleDetails = modelsContext.getModuleDetailsRegistry().resolveModuleDetails( module );","+\t\t\tfinal var annotation = moduleDetails.getDirectAnnotationUsage( DefaultListSemantics.class );","+\t\t\tif ( annotation != null ) {","+\t\t\t\treturn CollectionClassification.valueOf( annotation.value().name() );","+\t\t\t}","+\t\t}","+\t\treturn buildingContext.getBuildingOptions().getMappingDefaults().getImplicitListClassification();","+\t}","+"," \tprivate static Class<?> determineSemanticJavaType(MemberDetails property) {"," \t\tif ( property.isPlural() ) {"," \t\t\treturn inferCollectionClassFromSubclass("],"additions":29,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"hibernate-core/src/main/java/org/hibernate/boot/model/source/internal/OverriddenMappingDefaults.java","lines":["@@ -35,6 +35,12 @@ public class OverriddenMappingDefaults implements EffectiveMappingDefaults {"," \tprivate final EnumSet<CascadeType> cascadeTypes;"," \tprivate final CollectionClassification implicitListClassification;"," ","+\t/**","+\t * @deprecated Use {@link Builder} for other defaults and {@link org.hibernate.annotations.DefaultListSemantics}","+\t * for list semantics.","+\t * Scheduled for removal in 9.0.","+\t */","+\t@Deprecated(since = \"8.0\", forRemoval = true)"," \tpublic OverriddenMappingDefaults("," \t\t\tString implicitSchemaName,"," \t\t\tString implicitCatalogName,","@@ -139,6 +145,7 @@ public AccessType getDefaultCacheAccessType() {"," \t}"," "," \t@Override","+\t@Deprecated(since = \"8.0\", forRemoval = true)"," \tpublic CollectionClassification getDefaultListClassification() {"," \t\treturn implicitListClassification;"," \t}","@@ -268,10 +275,20 @@ public Builder setImplicitCacheAccessType(AccessType implicitCacheAccessType) {"," \t\t\treturn this;"," \t\t}"," ","+\t\t/**","+\t\t * @deprecated Use {@link org.hibernate.annotations.DefaultListSemantics} on a package or module.","+\t\t * Scheduled for removal in 9.0.","+\t\t */","+\t\t@Deprecated(since = \"8.0\", forRemoval = true)"," \t\tpublic CollectionClassification getImplicitListClassification() {"," \t\t\treturn implicitListClassification;"," \t\t}"," ","+\t\t/**","+\t\t * @deprecated Use {@link org.hibernate.annotations.DefaultListSemantics} on a package or module.","+\t\t * Scheduled for removal in 9.0.","+\t\t */","+\t\t@Deprecated(since = \"8.0\", forRemoval = true)"," \t\tpublic Builder setImplicitListClassification(CollectionClassification implicitListClassification) {"," \t\t\tif ( implicitListClassification != null ) {"," \t\t\t\tthis.implicitListClassification = implicitListClassification;"],"additions":17,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"hibernate-core/src/main/java/org/hibernate/boot/models/HibernateAnnotations.java","lines":["@@ -283,6 +283,12 @@ public interface HibernateAnnotations {"," \t\t\tEnumSet.of( Kind.METHOD, Kind.FIELD, Kind.ANNOTATION ),"," \t\t\tfalse"," \t);","+\tOrmAnnotationDescriptor<DefaultListSemantics, DefaultListSemanticsAnnotation> DEFAULT_LIST_SEMANTICS = new OrmAnnotationDescriptor<>(","+\t\t\tDefaultListSemantics.class,","+\t\t\tDefaultListSemanticsAnnotation.class,","+\t\t\tEnumSet.of( Kind.PACKAGE, Kind.MODULE ),","+\t\t\tfalse","+\t);"," \tOrmAnnotationDescriptor<DiscriminatorFormula, DiscriminatorFormulaAnnotation> DISCRIMINATOR_FORMULA = new OrmAnnotationDescriptor<>("," \t\t\tDiscriminatorFormula.class,"," \t\t\tDiscriminatorFormulaAnnotation.class,"],"additions":6,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"hibernate-core/src/main/java/org/hibernate/boot/models/annotations/internal/DefaultListSemanticsAnnotation.java","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,43 @@","+/*","+ * SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0","+ * Copyright Red Hat Inc. and Hibernate Authors","+ */","+package org.hibernate.boot.models.annotations.internal;","+","+import java.lang.annotation.Annotation;","+import java.util.Map;","+","+import org.hibernate.annotations.DefaultListSemantics;","+import org.hibernate.models.spi.ModelsContext;","+","+/// @author Steve Ebersole","+@SuppressWarnings({ \"ClassExplicitlyAnnotation\", \"unused\" })","+@jakarta.annotation.Generated(\"org.hibernate.orm.build.annotations.ClassGeneratorProcessor\")","+public class DefaultListSemanticsAnnotation implements DefaultListSemantics {","+\tprivate Classification value;","+","+\tpublic DefaultListSemanticsAnnotation(ModelsContext modelContext) {","+\t}","+","+\tpublic DefaultListSemanticsAnnotation(DefaultListSemantics annotation, ModelsContext modelContext) {","+\t\tvalue = annotation.value();","+\t}","+","+\tpublic DefaultListSemanticsAnnotation(Map<String, Object> attributeValues, ModelsContext modelContext) {","+\t\tvalue = (Classification) attributeValues.get( \"value\" );","+\t}"